# Backends
msgid "Hugging Face"
msgstr "Hugging Face"

msgid ""
"Hugging Face Inference Providers (router.huggingface.co): open models served "
"by Together, Fireworks, Novita, DeepInfra and others behind one OpenAI-"
"compatible endpoint. Pricing and context length are prefilled for smart "
"routing."
msgstr ""
"Proveedores de inferencia de Hugging Face (router.huggingface.co): modelos "
"abiertos servidos por Together, Fireworks, Novita, DeepInfra y otros detrás "
"de un único endpoint compatible con OpenAI. Los precios y la longitud de "
"contexto se precargan para el enrutamiento inteligente."

